abstract = {Clouds are an important visual element of any natural scene and computer artists often wish to create specific cloud shapes (for example in the film Am\'{e}lie, as depicted in Fig 1). We describe a sketch based interface for modeling cumulous clouds. This interface allows rapid construction of a 3D cloud surface representation (mesh) using an underlying point based implicit surface representation. This mesh is rendered using the technique [BNM*08], resulting in a realtime cloud modeling and rendering system.},
