abstract = {The Texas rancher is trying to impress the English farmer with the size of his property. “I can drive out at dawn across my land, and by sundown I still haven’t reached my ranch’s borders.” The Englishman nods sympathetically and says, “Yes, yes, I know what you mean. I have a car like that, too.”},
